Mount point for the abstergo container's /data volume. Tracked only so a fresh
checkout has a directory to bind; everything written into it is ignored by
.gitignore, because the file that lands here -- swap_intents.json -- is a
fund-releasing authority and must never enter git history.

The directory must be writable by uid 1000: the image runs as the non-root
`node` user, and a bind mount is created with the host's ownership, so a
root-owned directory here makes the server fail its first write rather than
its startup.
